---
// src/components/bangalore/ThreeNumbers.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-white w-full">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-4">
        Three numbers that never match
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 font-medium">
        Your POS shows the first. The app shows the second. Nobody puts all three together.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">What you sold</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">
          Every order your kitchen sent out last month.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-rose-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-rose-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-rose-200 text-rose-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">What they say they owe you</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">
          After commission, discounts, ads and penalties.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-emerald-50 rounded-3xl p-8 border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-200 text-emerald-700 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">What reached your bank</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium">
          The amount actually credited to your account.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 text-center">
      <div class="inline-block bg-slate-900 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl shadow-xl transform -rotate-1">
        <p class="text-xl">That is where <span class="text-rose-400">wrong charges</span> sit for months.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
